# Snyk (https://snyk.io) policy file, patches or ignores known vulnerabilities
version: v1.25.0
ignore:
  'SNYK-JS-INFLIGHT-6095116':
    - '*':
        reason: 'Not reachable in application runtime — inflight is only present via glob from @defra/interactive-map/polygon-splitter package metadata and dev/build tooling; grants-ui and the shipped map bundles do not import glob or inflight. Re-checked 2026-08-24 on @defra/interactive-map 0.0.40-alpha: polygon-splitter still pins glob@^8, which requires inflight; no upstream fix available. Reassess for interactive-map/polygon-splitter dependency removal.'
        expires: '2026-09-24'
  'SNYK-JS-IMAGESIZE-17295814':
    - '*':
        reason: 'Build-time only - vulnerable path is docusaurus mdx-loader in @defra/interactive-map docs (@defra/forms-engine-plugin > @defra/interactive-map > @docusaurus/theme-common > @docusaurus/mdx-loader > image-size), never loaded by grants-ui runtime. Re-checked 2026-08-24 on @defra/interactive-map 0.0.40-alpha: no upstream fix or patch available in the docusaurus-pinned image-size range. Remove once @defra/interactive-map drops the docusaurus toolchain or image-size ships a fix.'
        expires: '2026-09-24'
  'SNYK-JS-IMAGESIZE-17295816':
    - '*':
        reason: 'Build-time only - vulnerable path is docusaurus mdx-loader in @defra/interactive-map docs (@defra/forms-engine-plugin > @defra/interactive-map > @docusaurus/theme-common > @docusaurus/mdx-loader > image-size), never loaded by grants-ui runtime. Re-checked 2026-08-24 on @defra/interactive-map 0.0.40-alpha: no upstream fix or patch available in the docusaurus-pinned image-size range. Remove once @defra/interactive-map drops the docusaurus toolchain or image-size ships a fix.'
        expires: '2026-09-24'
  'SNYK-JS-FASTURI-19502739':
    - '*':
        reason: 'Build/dev-tooling only - fast-uri is reached solely via ajv under webpack schema-utils and the docusaurus toolchain in @defra/interactive-map (@defra/forms-engine-plugin > @defra/interactive-map > @docusaurus/theme-common > @docusaurus/mdx-loader > @docusaurus/utils > @docusaurus/types > webpack > css-minimizer-webpack-plugin > schema-utils > ajv > fast-uri); this is the single resolved copy and the grants-ui Hapi server runtime never loads it. Checked 2026-09-03: the earlier fast-uri advisories are gone - the tree now resolves 3.1.6 - but these two land on 3.1.6 itself. The fixes 3.1.7/2.4.6/4.1.4 were published 2026-09-02T11:06Z and are still inside the .npmrc min-release-age=7 cooldown (eligible 2026-09-09T11:06Z) - npm install fails with "ETARGET notarget No matching version found for fast-uri@3.1.7 with a date before 8/27/2026". Remove this ignore and add overrides.fast-uri 3.1.7 once the cooldown clears.'
        expires: '2026-09-24'
  'SNYK-JS-FASTURI-19502854':
    - '*':
        reason: 'Build/dev-tooling only - fast-uri is reached solely via ajv under webpack schema-utils and the docusaurus toolchain in @defra/interactive-map (@defra/forms-engine-plugin > @defra/interactive-map > @docusaurus/theme-common > @docusaurus/mdx-loader > @docusaurus/utils > @docusaurus/types > webpack > css-minimizer-webpack-plugin > schema-utils > ajv > fast-uri); this is the single resolved copy and the grants-ui Hapi server runtime never loads it. Checked 2026-09-03: the earlier fast-uri advisories are gone - the tree now resolves 3.1.6 - but these two land on 3.1.6 itself. The fixes 3.1.7/2.4.6/4.1.4 were published 2026-09-02T11:06Z and are still inside the .npmrc min-release-age=7 cooldown (eligible 2026-09-09T11:06Z) - npm install fails with "ETARGET notarget No matching version found for fast-uri@3.1.7 with a date before 8/27/2026". Remove this ignore and add overrides.fast-uri 3.1.7 once the cooldown clears.'
        expires: '2026-09-24'
  'SNYK-JS-QS-19432017':
    - '*':
        reason: 'Build/dev-tooling only - qs is reached solely via express/body-parser under webpack-dev-server in the docusaurus toolchain of @defra/interactive-map (@defra/forms-engine-plugin > @defra/interactive-map > @easyops-cn/docusaurus-search-local > @docusaurus/plugin-content-docs > @docusaurus/core > webpack-dev-server > express > qs) and via the dev-only typed-rest-client; the grants-ui Hapi server runtime does not use qs. Checked 2026-09-01: the single resolved copy is pinned by our own overrides.qs in package.json, and the fix qs 6.16.0 was published 2026-08-29, still inside the .npmrc min-release-age=7 cooldown (eligible 2026-09-05). Dropping the override does not help - webpack-dev-server > body-parser requires ~6.15.1, which resolves to the still-vulnerable 6.15.3. Remove this ignore and bump overrides.qs to 6.16.0 once the cooldown clears.'
        expires: '2026-09-24'
  'SNYK-JS-QS-19432019':
    - '*':
        reason: 'Build/dev-tooling only - qs is reached solely via express/body-parser under webpack-dev-server in the docusaurus toolchain of @defra/interactive-map (@defra/forms-engine-plugin > @defra/interactive-map > @easyops-cn/docusaurus-search-local > @docusaurus/plugin-content-docs > @docusaurus/core > webpack-dev-server > express > qs) and via the dev-only typed-rest-client; the grants-ui Hapi server runtime does not use qs. Checked 2026-09-01: the single resolved copy is pinned by our own overrides.qs in package.json, and the fix qs 6.16.0 was published 2026-08-29, still inside the .npmrc min-release-age=7 cooldown (eligible 2026-09-05). Dropping the override does not help - webpack-dev-server > body-parser requires ~6.15.1, which resolves to the still-vulnerable 6.15.3. Remove this ignore and bump overrides.qs to 6.16.0 once the cooldown clears.'
        expires: '2026-09-24'
